00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:16.000
We'll take it from the master.
 
 
 
As one of the most prolific and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.480
beloved actors working in Hollywood today,&nbsp;
it's somewhat surprising that a Shakespearian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:24.720
