jeez Denzel! Anyway, moving along!
 
 
 &nbsp;

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:58.880
It's not hard to guess why Al Pacino, an&nbsp;
actor most well-known for playing mobsters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:05.120
has a spot on this list. With an impressive 255&nbsp;
swear words to his name, Pacino comes in at number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:09.440
five. While you might think someone as loud and&nbsp;
commanding as Pacino would be a shoo-in for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:14.960
Martin Scorsese film, the two only ever worked&nbsp;
together for 2019's Netflix film, The Irishman.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:20.950
"That f---ing c--------- Kennedy has&nbsp;
got his nose up my a-- everywhere I go."

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:25.440
If you're a big Pacino fan, you might be able to&nbsp;
