Comedy legend Adam Sandler comes in at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:05.200
number four on the list, with Buzz Bingo&nbsp;
claiming he’s dropped a whopping 295 swear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:09.920
