spoken an astounding 376 swear words on screen.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.560
“It’s Bulls—, and I’m sorry.”

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:10.320
Considering the other actors on this list,&nbsp;
this is not actually all that surprising,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:15.360
as Hill stars alongside DiCaprio in the overly&nbsp;
explicit The Wolf Of Wall Street. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:20.240
out of every 1,000 words Hill's character&nbsp;
Donnie speaks, 74 of them are swear words,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:24.240
