DiCaprio's character proportionally.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:28.400
While a significant number of swear words in&nbsp;
Hill's overall count come from The Wolf Of Wall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:33.200
Street, it's not the only curse-heavy movie in&nbsp;
his filmography. When you look at the cold, hard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:38.720
numbers, Hill's most profane role is his character&nbsp;
Seth in Superbad. Seth is a high schooler on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:44.720
