"F--- you."

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:55.200
21 Jump Street, Knocked Up, and This Is&nbsp;
The End are a few other R-rated comedies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:59.040
in Hill's repertoire that likely&nbsp;
contributed to his winning status.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:02.480
Though Jackson may have been peeved not&nbsp;
to clinch the number one spot on the list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:08.560
